WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Start with the measure: choose the number you want to understand.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Choose the aggregation. Sum adds the selected value across matching rows.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Choose a dimension to split the measure into groups, such as import versus export.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Add another dimension for a grouped-in-group comparison, such as reporting period.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Use filters, sorting and limits to focus the answer on your business question.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Change the chart, show labels, export the result or pin it. Every control remains editable.
